{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20958","headline":"钓鱼诗 · 李贺","name":"钓鱼诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋水钓红渠，仙人待素书。\n菱丝萦独茧，蒲米蛰双鱼。\n斜竹垂清沼，长纶贯碧虚。\n饵悬春[蜥蜴]，钩坠小蟾蜍。\n詹子情无限，龙阳恨有余。\n爲看烟浦上，楚女泪沾裾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}